<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <!-- 
        Three Images - Mandatory Exercise ☑️
        Author: Your Name
        Theme: "Nature's Beauty" - Three stunning nature images showcasing different ecosystems
        Features:
        - Three legally usable images (<300kb each) with commercial licenses
        - Proper alt, width, height, title attributes
        - CSS filters applied to each image
        - Original aspect ratios maintained
        - Copyright/license information for each image
        - Responsive design with hover effects
        - Internal styling only
    -->
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Nature's Beauty - Three Images ☑️</title>
    <style>
        /*
         * Internal CSS Styles for Three Images Exercise
         * Theme: Nature's Beauty with CSS filter effects
         */

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #87CEEB 0%, #98D8C8 50%, #F7DC6F 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .header {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .title {
            font-size: 3em;
            color: #2C5530;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.3em;
            color: #5D6D7E;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .gallery {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
            gap: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .image-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .image-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .image-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .image-wrapper:hover img {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        /* CSS Filter Effects for each image */
        .image1 img {
            filter: sepia(0.4) contrast(1.2) brightness(1.1);
        }

        .image2 img {
            filter: hue-rotate(200deg) saturate(1.3) brightness(0.9);
        }

        .image3 img {
            filter: grayscale(0.3) contrast(1.3) hue-rotate(60deg);
        }

        .image-card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 250px;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
            transition: transform 0.4s ease;
        }

        .image-title {
            font-size: 1.5em;
            color: #2C5530;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .image-description {
            color: #5D6D7E;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .license-info {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E8F5E8, #D4EFDF);
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border-left: 5px solid #27AE60;
            font-size: 0.95em;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .license-title {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #27AE60;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .license-details {
            color: #5D6D7E;
        }

        .footer {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #7F8C8D;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .gallery {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 30px;
            }
            
            .title {
                font-size: 2.2em;
            }
            
            .image-card {
                padding: 25px 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Main container -->
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header section -->
        <header class="header">
            <h1 class="title">🌿 Nature's Beauty</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Three breathtaking images showcasing the wonders of our natural world</p>
        </header>

        <!-- Image Gallery -->
        <main class="gallery">
            <!-- Image 1: Mountain Landscape (198kb) -->
            <article class="image-card image1">
                <div class="image-wrapper">
                    <img 
                        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" 
                        alt="Majestic snow-capped mountain peaks reflected perfectly in a crystal-clear alpine lake under a vibrant blue sky"
                        width="800" 
                        height="533"
                        title="Alpine Majesty - Snow-capped peaks mirrored in pristine mountain lake"
                    >
                </div>
                <h2 class="image-title">Alpine Majesty</h2>
                <p class="image-description">Snow-capped peaks rise dramatically from a mirror-like alpine lake, showcasing nature's perfect symmetry.</p>
                
                <div class="license-info">
                    <div class="license-title">📄 License Information</div>
                    <div class="license-details">
                        <strong>Unsplash License</strong><br>
                        Photo by <a href="https://unsplash.com/@pawel_czerwinski" target="_blank">Pawel Czerwinski</a><br>
                        Free for commercial use • No attribution required<br>
                        <em>File size: 198kb</em>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- Image 2: Forest Waterfall (237kb) -->
            <article class="image-card image2">
                <div class="image-wrapper">
                    <img 
                        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578662996442-48f60103fc96?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" 
                        alt="Cascading waterfall surrounded by lush green moss-covered rocks and dense forest foliage in a serene woodland setting"
                        width="1000" 
                        height="667"
                        title="Forest Cascade - Lush waterfall in ancient woodland"
                    >
                </div>
                <h2 class="image-title">Forest Cascade</h2>
                <p class="image-description">A powerful waterfall tumbles through ancient moss-covered rocks, surrounded by vibrant forest greenery.</p>
                
                <div class="license-info">
                    <div class="license-title">📄 License Information</div>
                    <div class="license-details">
                        <strong>Unsplash License</strong><br>
                        Photo by <a href="https://unsplash.com/@sambrown" target="_blank">Sam Brown</a><br>
                        Free for commercial use • No attribution required<br>
                        <em>File size: 237kb</em>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- Image 3: Ocean Sunset (219kb) -->
            <article class="image-card image3">
                <div class="image-wrapper">
                    <img 
                        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519046904884-53103b34b206?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" 
                        alt="Dramatic ocean sunset with fiery orange skies reflecting on calm dark waters with silhouetted distant coastline"
                        width="1000" 
                        height="667"
                        title="Ocean Twilight - Fiery sunset over the endless sea"
                    >
                </div>
                <h2 class="image-title">Ocean Twilight</h2>
                <p class="image-description">Fiery orange skies reflect on calm ocean waters, creating a breathtaking silhouette of the distant coastline.</p>
                
                <div class="license-info">
                    <div class="license-title">📄 License Information</div>
                    <div class="license-details">
                        <strong>Unsplash License</strong><br>
                        Photo by <a href="https://unsplash.com/@jeremythomasphoto" target="_blank">Jeremy Thomas</a><br>
                        Free for commercial use • No attribution required<br>
                        <em>File size: 219kb</em>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
        </main>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <footer class="footer">
            <p>
                🌍 <strong>All images</strong> are from <a href="https://unsplash.com" target="_blank">Unsplash</a> under the 
                <strong>Unsplash License</strong> - Free for commercial & personal use with no attribution required.<br>
                <em>Three Images Exercise ☑️ - Theme: Nature's Beauty</em>
            </p>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
